### Author Register
POST http://localhost:4000/author-api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Sam",
  "lastName": "K",
  "email": "sam2@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Author Login
POST http://localhost:4000/common-api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sam2@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
  
}



### Create article (AUTHOR)
POST http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author":"69ae8de4afc1f47f53df9f14",
  "title":"test2 article",
  "category":"programming",
  "content":"content of test2 article"
}



###Read articles of a author
GET http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles/6989ef4eb3acfbbf9f926145



### Update article (AUTHOR)
PUT http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author":"69ae8de4afc1f47f53df9f14",
  "articleId":"69aeda9d73dfcedbdb6a4483",
  "title":"test2 article updated",
  "category":"programming",
  "content":"content of test2 article updated"
}
### delete article
PATCH http://localhost:4000/author-api/articles/69ae8fd8170e0d5d18e82687/status
Content-Type: application/json


{"isArticleActive":true}

### Logout
post http://localhost:4000/common-api/logout

###changing password
PUT http://localhost:4000/common-api/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role":"AUTHOR",
  "email":"sam2@mail.com",
  "currentPassword": "12345",
  "newPassword":"sam@123"
}
